{"nodes": [{"id": "app_templates_dashboard_index", "label": "Dashboard Index Template", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/templates/dashboard/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_templates_dashboard_index_css_bar_chart", "label": "Dependency-Free CSS Bar Chart", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/templates/dashboard/index.html", "source_location": "lines 49-66", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Views-over-time is drawn as plain CSS div bars whose height is a percentage of the series peak ('plain CSS bars, no charting library'). Trades interactivity and axis labelling for zero JS dependencies, no CDN asset, and a chart that renders identically in the server-rendered page with no client bootstrap."}, {"id": "app_templates_dashboard_index_system_health_panel", "label": "System Health Panel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/templates/dashboard/index.html", "source_location": "lines 113-127", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Renders a list of {level, title, detail} checks with a colour dot. Commented as 'the panel that explains why nothing is happening' - it exists so an idle bot (no connected account, scheduler not running, no rights confirmed) reports its own cause instead of silently doing nothing."}, {"id": "app_templates_dashboard_index_live_queue_contract", "label": "Live Queue DOM Contract", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/templates/dashboard/index.html", "source_location": "lines 133-157", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A container id 'queue-live' plus per-row 'data-job-id' and per-cell 'data-job-status' / 'data-job-percent' hooks form the contract the static poller (app/static/js/app.js) uses to patch job rows in place from /api/queue. Progressive enhancement: the server renders the correct state first, JS only refreshes it."}, {"id": "app_templates_dashboard_index_library_health_meter", "label": "Monetisable Library Mix Meter", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/templates/dashboard/index.html", "source_location": "lines 78-110", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Splits ready-to-publish stock into monetisable vs royalty-free segments against a configured monetizable_target ratio, because royalty-free clips gather views but do not earn revenue share - the mix, not the raw count, is the health signal."}, {"id": "app_templates_dashboard_index_manual_job_trigger", "label": "Synchronous Manual Job Trigger", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/templates/dashboard/index.html", "source_location": "lines 231-267", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The scheduler normally runs in a separate 'socialbot-worker' service, so the web process often has no scheduler_jobs to list. Manual buttons run each job inline in the POST request instead - accepted as a slow request ('the page may take a few seconds - an upload run transfers the file before it returns') so the operation is still driveable from a web-only deployment."}], "edges": [{"source": "app_web_dashboard_index", "target": "app_templates_dashboard_index", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "app/templates/dashboard/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_templates_dashboard_index", "target": "app_web_videos_jobs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/templates/dashboard/index.html", "source_location": "line 136", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_templates_dashboard_index", "target": "app_web_videos_detail", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": 